        "custom_liquid": "<!-- HNDRD Racket Trials — animated text-only hero (paste into Shopify Custom Liquid) -->\n<section class=\"hndrd-th\" id=\"hndrd-th\">\n  <div class=\"hndrd-th__glow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n  <div class=\"hndrd-th__inner\">\n    <p class=\"hndrd-th__eyebrow\">HNDRD Racket Trials</p>\n    <h1 class=\"hndrd-th__title\">\n      <span class=\"hndrd-th__line\"><span class=\"hndrd-th__word\">Felt the difference.</span></span>\n      <span class=\"hndrd-th__line\"><span class=\"hndrd-th__word hndrd-th__shine\">Now play with it.</span></span>\n    </h1>\n    <span class=\"hndrd-th__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n    <p class=\"hndrd-th__sub\">Share your details. Stay in the game.</p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<style>\n  .hndrd-th {\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    color: #111;\n    padding: clamp(50px, 9vw, 110px) 2px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n  }\n  .hndrd-th__inner { position: relative; z-index: 1; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; }\n\n  /* soft drifting light behind the text */\n  .hndrd-th__glow {\n    position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 50%;\n    width: 640px; height: 640px; margin: -320px 0 0 -320px;\n    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(0,0,0,0.06) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 65%);\n    filter: blur(20px);\n    animation: hndrd-drift 9s ease-in-out infinite alternate;\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n  @keyframes hndrd-drift {\n    from { transform: translate(-80px, -20px) scale(1); }\n    to   { transform: translate(80px, 20px) scale(1.15); }\n  }\n\n  /* eyebrow: fades in while tracking tightens */\n  .hndrd-th__eyebrow {\n    margin: 0 0 22px;\n    font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: #8a8a8a;\n    opacity: 0; letter-spacing: 0.6em;\n    transition: opacity 1s ease, letter-spacing 1.4s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1);\n  }\n\n  /* headline: each line slides up from a mask */\n  .hndrd-th__title {\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: clamp(36px, 7vw, 72px);\n    line-height: 1.08; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n  }\n  .hndrd-th__line { display: block; overflow: hidden; padding-bottom: 0.08em; }\n  .hndrd-th__word {\n    display: inline-block;\n    transform: translateY(110%);\n    transition: transform 1s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1);\n  }\n  .hndrd-th__line:nth-child(2) .hndrd-th__word { transition-delay: .18s; }\n\n  /* shimmer sweeping across second line */\n  .hndrd-th__shine {\n    font-weight: 500;\n    background: linear-gradient(100deg, #9a9a9a 30%, #111 48%, #111 52%, #9a9a9a 70%);\n    background-size: 250% 100%;\n    background-position: 100% 0;\n    -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text;\n    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; color: transparent;\n  }\n\n  /* rule draws outward from center */\n  .hndrd-th__rule {\n    display: block; height: 2px; width: 0; background: #111;\n    margin: clamp(22px, 4vw, 32px) auto;\n    transition: width 1s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1) .5s;\n  }\n\n  .hndrd-th__sub {\n    margin: 0; font-size: clamp(15px, 1.8vw, 19px);\n    color: #555; letter-spacing: 0.02em;\n    opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px);\n    transition: opacity .9s ease .8s, transform .9s ease .8s;\n  }\n\n  /* triggered state */\n  .hndrd-th.is-in .hndrd-th__eyebrow { opacity: 1; letter-spacing: 0.32em; }\n  .hndrd-th.is-in .hndrd-th__word { transform: translateY(0); }\n  .hndrd-th.is-in .hndrd-th__rule { width: 56px; }\n  .hndrd-th.is-in .hndrd-th__sub { opacity: 1; transform: none; }\n  .hndrd-th.is-in .hndrd-th__shine { animation: hndrd-shine 3.2s ease-in-out 1.2s infinite; }\n  @keyframes hndrd-shine {\n    0%   { background-position: 100% 0; }\n    60%, 100% { background-position: 0% 0; }\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 480px) {\n    .hndrd-th { padding: 48px 20px; }\n    .hndrd-th__glow { width: 420px; height: 420px; margin: -210px 0 0 -210px; }\n  }\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n    .hndrd-th *, .hndrd-th { animation: none !important; transition: none !important; }\n    .hndrd-th__eyebrow, .hndrd-th__sub { opacity: 1; transform: none; letter-spacing: 0.32em; }\n    .hndrd-th__word { transform: none; }\n    .hndrd-th__rule { width: 56px; }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<script>\n  (function () {\n    var el = document.getElementById('hndrd-th');\n    if (!el) return;\n    if (!('IntersectionObserver' in window)) { el.classList.add('is-in'); return; }\n    var io = new IntersectionObserver(function (entries) {\n      entries.forEach(function (e) {\n        if (e.isIntersecting) { el.classList.add('is-in'); io.disconnect(); }\n      });\n    }, { threshold: 0.3 });\n    io.observe(el);\n  })();\n</script>",
